istorical_business_count":0},{"category":"Event Planning & Services","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Southern","historical_business_count":2},{"category":"Caterers","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Salad","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Cajun/Creole, French, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"French, Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"RLlOK2fL6xU1sfIPiP2QBw","review_id":"IT0JzeG3olaZufwfALHKrg","date":"2016-06-10T22:20:49","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9482776522636414,"text_excerpt":"Stopped in here on a whim while walking around. We sat at the bar area, and our service was excellent. The bartender/server was very friendly and attentive. I ordered char-grilled oysters, my friends ordered fried catfish plate and BBQ shrimp. The portions on the catfish were unexpectedly huge (no way in hell could we finish, but we did give the rest to someone who could use to eat) I also got a cup of gumbo, which was very good, seasoned right and not overly fishy. The oysters were good, and I heard no complaints on the BBQ shrimp. Overall, a good experience that I'd recommend if you're in the area."},{"business_id":"RLlOK2fL6xU1sfIPiP2QBw","review_id":"LQ-2eNgbZJfOPGLW26qLkQ","date":"2014-06-12T14:37:57","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9481719136238098,"text_excerpt":"This was the best food I had in New Orleans, I went back twice. For New Orleans to be a food town, I had some horrible food my first few days in the city, but this place was during my last few days and it was great. I went 5/31 and 6/1 First, the service was outstanding. My first time was on a saturday night and it was EXTREMELY crowded. I dont know if its because its a tourist area and they want to make sure they arent saving tables for people who arent there but they make you give them your ID and they hold on to it in exchange for a pager. Never seen nor had to do that before. The bar was equally crowded with people waiting for tables or people dining. They told me it would be a 45- ho..."},{"business_id":"RLlOK2fL6xU1sfIPiP2QBw","review_id":"ufcfh7BrhUYcXv4KoErAng","date":"2015-09-18T21:09:43","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9463887810707092,"text_excerpt":"Man this place is good. I have no problem trucking through the funky smells of sin and regrets of bourbon street just to get here for the seafood boil potatoes! This is a seafood lovers haven! I ordered the half seafood platter. It consisted of fried catfish, shrimp, oysters, crawfish croquettes, coleslaw and fries. I added a soft shell crab for 5 bucks. Not only was the half seafood platter huge, it was super fresh and clean. The waiter was shocked that I was able to eat it all. FAT BOY PROBLEMS! I didn't care for the crawfish croquettes but my other half liked them. Oh...This fat boy also got the BBQ shrimp appetizer. It had 6 large shrimp and a baguette. The flavors were great but real..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"RLlOK2fL6xU1sfIPiP2QBw","photo_id":"2tirtTvDw6DwZ-noMVr4eg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/2tirtTvDw6DwZ-noMVr4eg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.848558783531189},{"business_id":"RLlOK2fL6xU1sfIPiP2QBw","photo_id":"qtM_VnsVIk3DrQNX19EWBQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/qtM_VnsVIk3DrQNX19EWBQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8355937004089355},{"business_id":"RLlOK2fL6xU1sfIPiP2QBw","photo_id":"iRYbKUbV3qELzOhZxf_AlA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/iRYbKUbV3qELzOhZxf_AlA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8334954977035522},{"business_id":"RLlOK2fL6xU1sfIPiP2QBw","photo_id":"v5lk2bWYgpIzZwqiZK2q8Q","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/v5lk2bWYgpIzZwqiZK2q8Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7965608835220337},{"business_id":"RLlOK2fL6xU1sfIPiP2QBw","photo_id":"53SWXlz2liGTi1q_IX_dEA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/53SWXlz2liGTi1q_IX_dEA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.734133243560791}]},"notebook_case":null}
